OL,3,GNEWSACross-Channel ferry set for final
OL,4,Asailing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cross-Channel ferry which has sailed
OL,7,Ffrom the Dorset coast for more than 30
OL,8,Fyears is set make its final journey on
OL,9,Fits route on Monday.
OL,11,FBrittany Ferries said Barfleur was
OL,12,Fscheduled to leave Poole, bound for
OL,13,FCherbourg in France, at 08:30 BST.
OL,15,FWith a flotilla of small boats
OL,16,Fpotentially accompanying the ferry,
OL,17,FPoole Harbour Commissioners said an
OL,18,Fexclusion zone would be in place
OL,19,Fsurrounding the ship and any small
OL,20,Fvessels should exercise "extreme
OL,21,Fcaution".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
