OL,3,GNEWSACross-Channel ferry set for final
OL,4,Asailing
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrittany Ferries announced earlier this
OL,7,Fyear it would end the route between
OL,8,FPoole-Cherbourg as well as Portsmouth
OL,9,FLe Havre, blaming rising taxes, Covid
OL,10,Floan repayments, unfair competition and
OL,11,Ffalling passenger numbers.
